<time>2025-11-07T09:55:51Z</time>
<name>Yr Wyddfa (Snowdon) summit</name>
<desc>There is a summit building, Hafod Eryri, which has a visitor centre, cafe, and toilet facilities. It is run by the Snowdon Mountain Railway and only open when trains are running, which is usually from early May to late October and dependent on the weather.</desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
