<name>Tryfan</name>
<desc>This is a challenging rocky scramble. The name 'Tryfan' is derived from Tri Faen, meaning three rocks, referring to the three rocky peaks that can be seen from some angles. Its danger should not be underestimated as there have been fatalities in the past.</desc>
